todos:
  - id: freeze-framework-replacement-boundary
    summary: 建立 extraction 任务 worktree，冻结当前 echo-agent main 与已推送 SDK
      source-continuity commit，并登记受控删除范围、保留的 ACP/runtime replacement 和回滚点。
    files:
      - echo-agent-worktrees/extract-sdk-from-framework/.echo-semantic/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/extract-sdk-from-framework/.echo-semantic/assets/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/extract-sdk-from-framework/.echo-semantic/findings/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/extract-sdk-from-framework/.echo-semantic/evidence/
    acceptance:
      - preflight、design/ADR authority、repair reference、delete paths、framework
        c5f7688 和 SDK b80cf06 source/remote SHA 均可复核，原 echo-agent 与
        echo-agent-sdk 工作树不被修改。
  - id: remove-sdk-workspace-assets
    summary: 从 echo-agent workspace 删除
      echo-sdk-protocol、echo-sdk-host、contracts/sdk、sdks 和 docs/sdk，并从
      scripts、learning contract 与 root manifests 移除 SDK 专属入口。
    files:
      - Cargo.toml
      - Cargo.lock
      - echo-sdk-protocol/
      - echo-sdk-host/
      - contracts/sdk/
      - sdks/
      - docs/sdk/
      - scripts/check-sdk-contracts.sh
      - scripts/check-language-sdks.sh
      - scripts/export-language-sdk-catalog.sh
      - echo-agent-learning/tests/documentation_contract.rs
    acceptance:
      - Cargo metadata 只列 framework/runtime 与 learning package；删除路径不再被活跃
        source、registration、test 或 script 引用，通用 ACP adapter 和 learning examples
        保持可用。
  - id: separate-framework-ci-and-docs
    summary: 将 root AGENTS、README、双语架构/生命周期文档、SDK ADR 指引、examples contract 和 GitHub
      workflow 收敛为 framework-only 事实源，并以独立 SDK 仓库链接替代 package member 描述。
    files:
      - AGENTS.md
      - README.md
      - README.zh.md
      - docs/adr/0028-source-first-multilanguage-sdk-runtime.md
      - docs/adr/0031-sdk-identity-governance-scope.md
      - docs/adr/0032-sdk-contract-scope-classification.md
      - docs/en/architecture.md
      - docs/zh/architecture.md
      - docs/en/lifecycles.md
      - docs/zh/lifecycles.md
      - .github/workflows/rust-ci.yml
      - echo-agent-learning/tests/documentation_contract.rs
    acceptance:
      - framework 文档只描述 framework ACP boundary 和外部 SDK consumer link；SDK 专属 ADR
        正文只在新仓维护，framework 仅保留 superseded/ownership 指引；CI 不运行 SDK
        language/contract 工具链，双语链接与 topology contract 通过。
  - id: verify-and-deliver-framework-extraction
    summary: 完成 framework extraction 的语义连续性、工程门禁、review、commit 和远端推送，保留冻结 SDK commit
      与删除前后的回滚证据。
    files:
      - .echo-semantic/
      - AGENTS.md
      - Cargo.toml
      - Cargo.lock
      - .github/workflows/
      - README.md
      - README.zh.md
      - docs/
      - echo-agent-learning/tests/
    acceptance:
      - 所有适用命令零失败、零警告、零格式差异；任务分支 commit 使用关闭 GPG 签名方式并推送，远端 SHA 可复核。
